Port modifications
  overlay/: sparse draft proposer, StreamingLLM window, Vegas per-layer
  selection, variable-length reduction/top-k, and focused validation tools.
  patches/vllm-integration.patch: config, runner, attention backend and
  built-in FlashAttention wrapper integration.
  flash-attention/hopper/ and patches/flash-attention.patch: optional Vegas
  score arguments, first/last query score collection and sparse slot reads.
  Modification notices identify the changed source files.

